    <ChangeLog Version="7.1.5" Date="2025-08-13 13:57:34 +0200">Fixed - If the slim or slim-dark skin is activated and the search via the magnifying glass in the toolbar is selected, the button 'Create new' is halved.</ChangeLog>
    <ChangeLog Version="7.1.4" Date="2025-06-26 11:59:17 +0200">Fixed - Gravatar improperly displayed when using Slim Skin.</ChangeLog>
    <ChangeLog Version="7.1.3" Date="2025-03-17 09:23:52 +0100">Added missing Slim-Dark skin.</ChangeLog>
    <ChangeLog Version="7.1.2" Date="2024-08-27 10:22:29 +0200">Improved CSS for .WidgetSimple .Content - appeared in ITSMConfigurationManagement.</ChangeLog>
    <ChangeLog Version="7.1.1" Date="2024-07-24 19:45:20 +0200">Initial version for Znuny 7.1</ChangeLog>
